      "summary": "Impact 2030 is Santa Clara University's strategic plan focusing on global outreach, ethical and innovative education, and inclusivity for all talented students. It aims to prepare students for global societal shifts by leveraging Jesuit educational values and addressing today's technological and ethical challenges. The plan builds on recent successes, including increased diversity and high student retention, setting a roadmap for continued excellence and leadership in education.",
